### Authentication - Get Admin Token (Alice)
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/course-realm/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id = backend-app &
username = alice &
password = alice123 &
grant_type = password

> {% client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### Authentication - Get User Token (Bob)
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/course-realm/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id = backend-app &
username = bob &
password = bob123 &
grant_type = password

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### Products - List All
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products

### Products - Create (Admin)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cheeseburger",
  "description": "Juicy beef patty with cheddar cheese",
  "category": "Burgers",
  "price": 9.99,
  "stockQuantity": 100
}

> {% client.global.set("new_product_id", response.body.id); %}

### Products - Get By ID
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products/{{new_product_id}}

### Products - Update (Admin)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/products/{{new_product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Double Cheeseburger",
  "description": "Two juicy beef patties with extra cheddar cheese",
  "category": "Burgers",
  "price": 12.99,
  "stockQuantity": 50
}

### Orders - Place Order (User)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": {{new_product_id}},
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ],
  "deliveryAddress": "123 Main St, Springfield",
  "needsCutlery": true
}

> {% client.global.set("new_order_id", response.body.id); %}

### Orders - My Orders (User)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/orders/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Orders - Get Order Details (User)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/orders/{{new_order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Products - Delete (Admin)
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/products/{{new_product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Видалення замовлення адміністратором
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/orders/{{new_order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###
PATCH http://localhost:8081/api/orders/{{new_order_id}}/status?newStatus=DELIVERY
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}